# Mobile Development Rules

After making any changes to files in the `mobile/` directory:

1. **Always reload the app** after code changes by running:
   ```bash
   xcrun simctl launch --terminate-running-process booted com.internhub.app --url "exp+internhub://expo-development-client/?url=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A8081"
   ```

2. **Always**, restart Metro bundler with cache clear:
   ```bash
   lsof -ti :8081 | xargs kill -9 2>/dev/null
   cd /Users/ritesh/Documents/Per/Cursor/slack_clone/mobile && npx expo start --dev-client --clear &
   ```
   Then wait 5 seconds and relaunch the app.

3. **Always verify** the backend is running on port 3000 before testing mobile features.
